        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Steel or Aluminum Frame Glass Entry Door High Security Mortise Deadlatch Lock Sets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese complete mortise deadlatch sets with Bump Proof Mul-T-Lock mortise cylinder, cylinder lock guard and  Push / Pull paddle handle. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComplete kit to convert storefront glass doors from a <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadbolt-body-th1101\"><b>Mortise Deadbolt</b></a>  to a Deadlatch with Push / Pull Paddle Handle. For new installations <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-latch-installation-plate-don-jo-tb-215\"><b>Latch Installation Plates</b></a> are available. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Mortise Deadlatch\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset 31/32\", 1-1/8\" or 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Handed, Field Reversible </li>\r\n<li>Face plate: 1\" width x 6-7/8\" Length - Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Case Dimensions: 7/8\" Width x 6\" Lenth, Depth specific to backset (1.63\" - 1.78\").</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" width x 1.0\" length x 1/2\" Throw</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/TH1103.pdf?v=1704262220\" target=\"new\"\"><b>Global TH1103 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p> \r\n<b>Package Includes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1 <a href=\"/products/high-security-store-front-door-1-inch-mortise-cylinder-mul-t-lock-206sp-mor0c01-26\">Mul-T-Lock High Security Cylinder Lock</a></li> \r\n<li>1 <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-deadlatch-push-pull-handle-th1100-push\">Push / Pull Handle</a></li> \r\n<li>1 <a href=\"/products/mortise-cylinder-security-guard\">Cylinder Security Guard</a></li> \r\n<li>1 3/16\" Spacer/Trim Ring</li> \r\n<li>1 <a href=\"/products/storefront-door-mortise-lock-deadlatch-body-th1103\">Mortise Deadlatch Body</a></li> \r\n<li>1 <a href=\"/products/mortise-deadlatch-faceplate-th1100-fp11-15\">Flat Face Plate</a></li>\r\n<li>1 <a href=\"/products/mortise-deadlatch-single-strike-assembly-th1100-st2\">Strike Plate Assembly</a></li>\r\n<li>Includes cylinder set screws, trim and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish for trim.  When ordering more than 1 Set, you can have them Keyed Differently or Keyed Alike (same key for all sets).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Exit Devise is available in Aluminum or Duronotic (Dark Bronze) finish. Outside trim is always Aluminum finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Important</b> When selecting <b>Door Hand</b> for this exit device: \r\n<br>\r\n1. Stand on the <b>Push Side</b> of the door, facing the door. <br>\r\n2. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Left\", choose \"Left Hand Door\". <br>\r\n3. If the \"Pivot Hinge\" is on your \"Right\", choose \"Right Hand Door\". <br>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/closer-handing.gif?v=1704354510\"  width=\"410\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\"alt=\"door handing\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "High Security Storefront Door Mortise Deadlatch Lock Sets, Mul-T-Lock Cylinders, TH1103-PM",
                "description": "Steel or aluminum frame entry door Mortise Deadlatch Lock Sets - High Security Mortise Deadlatch Lock Sets with Mul-T-Lock restricted key cylinders. Complete deadatch package includes Push / Pull paddle, face plate and security cylinder lock guard.",
